---
// SECTION 3: WHAT I DO - 4 bento cards, copy persis dari index.html.
---
<section class="w-full py-20 lg:py-28" id="what-i-do">
  <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-margin-mobile lg:px-margin">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline justify-between mb-14 gap-4">
      <div>
        <span class="text-label-sm font-label-sm text-muted-brass uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2 font-mono">02 / DOMAINS</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-ink font-semibold tracking-tight">What I Do</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-body-sm font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant max-w-sm md:text-right">
        A blend of practical infrastructure capabilities and exploratory technological frontiers.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="card md:col-span-7 bg-surface-container p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-muted-brass font-mono font-bold">01</span>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center text-accent-oxblood group-hover:bg-accent-oxblood group-hover:text-paper quiet-accent transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-[1em] h-[1em] inline-block shrink-0 align-middle" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8C2F39" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 9V4M9.5 13.5 5 17M14.5 13.5 19 17M9 11H5M15 11h4"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-ink font-semibold mb-3">AI &amp; Intelligent Technologies</h3>
          <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Harnessing modern foundational models, prompt engineering, agentic systems, and AI-assisted workflows to accelerate problem solving, structure unstructured information, and prototype novel digital interfaces.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">LLM Tools</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">Agentic Patterns</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">Prompt Engineering</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">MCP Protocols</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card md:col-span-5 bg-surface-container p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-muted-brass font-mono font-bold">02</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-label-sm font-label-sm bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant uppercase font-mono tracking-wider">Interest · Exploration</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-ink font-semibold mb-3">Language &amp; AI Evaluation</h3>
          <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Exploring Indonesian computational linguistics, grammar heuristics, dataset quality verification, search result grading, and analytical text evaluation to refine AI alignment.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">Indonesian NLP</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">Data Annotation</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">Quality Assessment</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card md:col-span-5 bg-surface-container p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-muted-brass font-mono font-bold">03</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-label-sm font-label-sm bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant uppercase font-mono tracking-wider">Focus Area</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-ink font-semibold mb-3">Digital Operations &amp; Administration</h3>
          <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Systematic operational support, electronic record curation, structured spreadsheet modeling, document workflow optimization, and high-accuracy remote office administration.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">Office Advanced</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">SOP Documentation</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">Data Management</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card md:col-span-7 bg-surface-container p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-muted-brass font-mono font-bold">04</span>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center text-accent-oxblood group-hover:bg-accent-oxblood group-hover:text-paper quiet-accent transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-[1em] h-[1em] inline-block shrink-0 align-middle" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8C2F39" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M7 9l3 3-3 3M13 15h4"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-ink font-semibold mb-3">Software &amp; Automation</h3>
          <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Building modular fullstack interfaces, RESTful backend microservices, and autonomous scripting bots. Integrating modern web stacks with LLM endpoints and external API services.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">Next.js &amp; React</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">FastAPI Python</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">REST &amp; MCP</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-ink text-label-sm font-label-sm font-mono">Playwright</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
